      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹0.12 (vs ₹0.81 loss in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹0.12 (up from ₹0.81 loss in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹13.8b (down 6.3% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹147.5m (up ₹1.16b from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 1.1% (up from net loss in 3Q 2025). The move to profitability was driven by lower expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 25% per year but the company’s share price has only increased by 7% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings growth.",
